{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p style=\"text-align: left;\">《2026 香港小姐競選決賽》將於本周日晚（30 日）8 時在翡翠台現場直播，12 位候選佳麗將競逐本年度香港小姐冠、亞、季軍、最上鏡小姐、友誼小姐及總值超逾港幣651萬獎金及獎品。今屆港姐以「敢・至完美」為主題，大會特別邀請到馬國明、蕭正楠、曹永廉、陸浩明及鄭衍峰共 5 位男藝人組成星級司儀陣容。今次更是馬國明入行 26 年以來首度擔綱大型現場節目司儀，令人十分期待。</p><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\"><br/> <div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\"><br/> <img alt=\"螢幕截圖 2026-08-26 下午3.33.24.png\" src=\"https://tvb-vod-hk.oss-cn-hongkong.aliyuncs.com/uploads/image/2026/08/2026T0Z4eIVfuT1787729615.png\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"螢幕截圖 2026-08-26 下午3.33.24.png\"/><br/> </div><br/></div><p style=\"text-align: left;\">除了司儀陣容極具睇頭，決賽表演嘉賓同樣陣容鼎盛，邀請到李幸倪（Gin Lee）、曾比特、張與辰、梁漢文以及女團 MYNT 傾力演出。當中的重頭戲表演，梁漢文將會與陳楨怡、謝淑怡以及郭柏妍同台跨界合作。三位女藝人各展才藝：陳楨怡現場演奏豎琴，謝淑怡以優雅鋼琴應戰，而素有「魔音芊芊」之稱的郭柏妍更開口揚言今次會開聲唱歌！</p><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\"><br/> <div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\"><br/> <img alt=\"rositakpyy_1787464019_3969858334399869227_1457706649.jpg\" src=\"https://tvb-vod-hk.oss-cn-hongkong.aliyuncs.com/uploads/image/2026/08/202615hgzMCft81787729642.jpg\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"rositakpyy_1787464019_3969858334399869227_1457706649.jpg\"/><br/> </div><br/></div><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\"><br/> <div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\"><br/> <img alt=\"edmond4gorleung_1751422160_3667517355888329015_1318794.jpg\" src=\"https://tvb-vod-hk.oss-cn-hongkong.aliyuncs.com/uploads/image/2026/08/2026JngAPTm5cE1787729677.jpg\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"edmond4gorleung_1751422160_3667517355888329015_1318794.jpg\"/><br/> </div><br/></div><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\"><br/> <div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\"><br/> <img alt=\"zoietsy_1761053129_3748307780760497945_26526643896.jpg\" src=\"https://tvb-vod-hk.oss-cn-hongkong.aliyuncs.com/uploads/image/2026/08/2026TRZHIzQFHp1787729699.jpg\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"zoietsy_1761053129_3748307780760497945_26526643896.jpg\"/><br/> </div><br/></div><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\"><br/> <div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\"><br/> <img alt=\"celina_harto_1779510208_3903136772813157682_183272155.jpg\" src=\"https://tvb-vod-hk.oss-cn-hongkong.aliyuncs.com/uploads/image/2026/08/2026GEDKR43wVy1787729712.jpg\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"celina_harto_1779510208_3903136772813157682_183272155.jpg\"/><br/> </div><br/></div><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\">\n<div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\">\n<img alt=\"official.mynt_1782383588_3927236649121547666_19235457902.jpg\" src=\"https://tvb-vod-hk.oss-cn-hongkong.aliyuncs.com/uploads/image/2026/08/20261ZfDf0AY7d1787731331.jpg\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"official.mynt_1782383588_3927236649121547666_19235457902.jpg\"/>\n</div>\n</div></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-08-26T08:20:33.000066+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":346,"images":6,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none"}}